    32: { m: ["With {x1} = 5/3 and {x2} = 13/3 − {t}: 65/9 − 2{t}/3 and 65/9 − 8{t}/3 squares; multiplied by 36 and 9, 260 − 24{t} and 65 − 24{t} differ by 195 = 15 · 13, and 65 − 24{t} = 1 gives {t} = 8/3."] },
    33: { m: ["Homogeneous in ({x1}, {x2}): fixing {x2} = 12, the two equations in {x1} and {f} give {x1} = 8 and {f} = 7/12, Diophantus’s solution scaled by 7."] },
